Microsoft Windows MIDI Services Console
SDK Release Candidate 4 (GitHub Preview)
1.0.17-rc.4.25

Loopback endpoints created.

Unlike classic MIDI 1.0 loopbacks, these are fully MIDI 2.0-compatible 
bidirectional endpoints. Messages sent to Loopback A will be received by 
Loopback B. Messages sent by B will be received by A. MIDI 1.0 apps will see 4 
created ports (2 sources, 2 destinations) as a result.

These endpoints will disappear when the service or PC is restarted. To create 
permanent loopback endpoints, use the MIDI Settings app.

